# 🧠 3. CONTINUOUS NORMALS (CRITICAL — THIS IS WHY SUMO LOOKS CLEAN)

You MUST NOT compute normals per segment independently.

---

## Compute tangent + smooth normal

```scala
def computeNormals(curve: Vector[Point]): Vector[(Double, Double)] =
    curve.indices.map { i =>
        val pPrev = curve(math.max(i-1, 0))
        val pNext = curve(math.min(i+1, curve.length-1))

        val dx = pNext.x - pPrev.x
        val dy = pNext.y - pPrev.y
        val len = math.sqrt(dx*dx + dy*dy)

        if len == 0 then (0.0, 0.0)
        else (-dy / len, dx / len)
    }.toVector
```

👉 This removes ALL kinks.

